--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party model weights — Llama Prompt Guard 2
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Built with Llama.

Forage's Stage 3 prompt-injection classifier runs Meta's Llama Prompt Guard 2:
`meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M` by default, or
`meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-86M` when the operator selects it. Those model
weights are NOT part of
this repository, are NOT distributed with it, and are NOT covered by the
Apache License above. They are obtained at run time by the operator from the
Hugging Face gated repository, under the operator's own acceptance of:

    Llama 4 Community License Agreement
    https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/blob/main/models/llama4/LICENSE

    Llama 4 Acceptable Use Policy
    https://www.llama.com/llama4/use-policy/

Llama Materials — including Llama Prompt Guard 2 and its outputs — remain
governed by that agreement, which carries its own attribution, naming, and
acceptable-use obligations. Operators who redistribute an image or artifact
containing the weights must carry those obligations forward.

"Llama" and "Meta" are trademarks of Meta Platforms, Inc. Forage is not
sponsored by, endorsed by, or affiliated with Meta Platforms, Inc.

The score cassettes under tests/corpus/cassettes/ hold numeric outputs of
`meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M` and, where recorded,
`meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-86M`: per-window scores and window counts,
keyed by the SHA-256 of each classified text, at the revision named in each
file's name and `revision` field. They are outputs of Llama Materials and are
governed by the Llama licence cited above. They hold no model internals (no
weights, tokenizer or configuration) and no input text. They are test data
only and none is shipped in the image.

